<title>FRANCE: Club Med seen ending 1996 in red -paper.</title>
<headline>Club Med seen ending 1996 in red -paper.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>French holiday and leisure company Club Mediterranee, whose board meets on Friday, is expected to have finished the 1996 financial year in the red and could announce a &quot;series of important measures in the strategic and management domain&quot;, La Tribune newspaper said on Friday.</p>
<p>The group made a net attributable loss of 169 million francs in the year to October 31 1995.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
